    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a classic 2D retro RPG in the style of IronBorn.<br><br>The Kingdom is protected by the Sacred Flame, a source of power that can only be used by the Flame's Heir. This individual comes from a very long lineage of warriors that wage an eternal war against evil.<br>Vaynard, the son of a veteran of war, is called upon a quest he could never anticipate. Now, the anxious young man must step into the role of the hero he always dreamt of being, though in reality, that roles comes not only with it's glory but also with all it's perils.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br> * Classic visuals<br> * Classic storyline that embodies what is great in the genre<br> * Mouse Support<br> * Quest Journal<br> * Three difficulty levels",
